WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.864
In this video, you will claim a home that is already on the map, so your own photos and details replace the automatic listing.

00:00:07.864 --> 00:00:09.040
We start on the map.

00:00:09.946 --> 00:00:14.008
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:14.008 --> 00:00:16.133
That is the only address you need.

00:00:18.132 --> 00:00:20.539
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:20.539 --> 00:00:24.283
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:24.283 --> 00:00:25.620
Tap Use my location.

00:00:27.356 --> 00:00:31.794
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:31.794 --> 00:00:34.998
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:34.998 --> 00:00:39.559
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:47.287
Say you spot your own home on the map, listed from a public list of homes.

00:00:47.287 --> 00:00:50.095
Search for your street, and open your home's card.

00:00:52.472 --> 00:00:56.381
Homes we found on public lists have a link at the bottom of the card.

00:00:56.381 --> 00:00:57.665
Tap Is this your home?

00:00:57.665 --> 00:00:58.168
Claim it.

00:01:00.156 --> 00:01:05.658
The form opens with your address already filled in, and tells you which listing you are claiming.

00:01:05.658 --> 00:01:07.174
Tap A homeowner, then Next.

00:01:09.691 --> 00:01:13.083
Type the name to show, like the Park family, then tap Next.

00:01:15.549 --> 00:01:18.723
If a company installed your lights, you can name them here.

00:01:18.723 --> 00:01:20.946
We did it ourselves, so tap No, then Next.

00:01:23.436 --> 00:01:24.994
Tap Christmas, then Next.

00:01:27.497 --> 00:01:29.761
The name is filled in from the listing.

00:01:29.761 --> 00:01:33.893
Change it if you like, and tell families what makes your lights special.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:34.686
Then tap Next.

00:01:37.387 --> 00:01:38.417
Check the address.

00:01:38.417 --> 00:01:40.694
It is already filled in, so just tap Next.

00:01:42.642 --> 00:01:45.750
Telling families when your lights are on is optional.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.268
Tap Next.

00:01:48.045 --> 00:01:50.660
Add photos of your own lights, taken at night.

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:53.442
They replace the picture on the automatic listing.

00:01:56.311 --> 00:01:59.191
Finally, check everything, and tap Put it on the map.

00:02:01.275 --> 00:02:02.013
That is it.

00:02:02.013 --> 00:02:08.657
Once the site owner approves your home, it replaces the automatic listing, with your own photos and details.

00:02:10.061 --> 00:02:12.301
Next up: Feature your event or home.
